ence (weather, computer). Weaknesses: communication tone, pretentiousness (crew cooperation). Good.\n\nCandidate C: anticipates dangerous situations, sees complex connections, excellent spatial vision, very good leadership, but unfriendly, eats unhealthily. Strengths: situational awareness, technical competence, leadership. Weaknesses: unfriendly (crew cooperation), health maybe reliability.\n\nCandidate D: responds to unexpected events adequately, concentrates well, solves problems extremely well, takes responsibility seriously, moody, loner. Strengths: problem solving, responsibility, concentration. Weaknesses: moodiness, loner (crew cooperation). \n\nWe need to pick best overall fit. Likely B seems balanced: reliability, stress, technical, but communication issues. A has decision speed and attention but communication issues. C has strong situational awareness but unfriendly. D has problem solving but moodiness.\n\nProbably B is strongest overall, as reliability and stress are crucial. Communication tone issues but can be trained. So vote for Candidate B.\n\nWe need to reference discussion: none yet, but we can say \"Starting the discussion\". Provide evidence: B is very conscientious (operational reliability) and handles stress well (stress resilience). Also note communication concerns.\n\nThus vote B.\n\nNow produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON."}
